  _subtitle: How do I play the demo?
  _description: 'Open Scenes/Oz Demo.unity in the sample folder and press Play. [[fcbf3650-903d-4ed3-a6f8-79e222116920|Dorothy
    Gale]] starts at the [[9af71760-1bb0-4dc8-a754-badc739e61bf|Kansas Farm]]; click
    a place on the map to travel, pick up Items and complete the Quests of the book.


    The
    whole game state lives in Lore Fields, changed at runtime through the Runtime
    API. Values that differ from the Lore data are marked in the view.'
